1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,795
M: Do you know how many people are going to show up this evening?

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:05,375
I need to call the restaurant to make a reservation.

3
00:00:06,425 --> 00:00:08,735
W: There will be about 10, including me and you.

4
00:00:09,295 --> 00:00:11,435
Why don't you check with Shirley just to make sure?

5
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:14,515
She is the one who knows exactly who will be showing up.

6
00:00:14,975 --> 00:00:18,715
M: All right, but she stepped out for a moment to mail something at the post office.

7
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:22,175
I will drop by her office after I come back from lunch.

8
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:24,035
Do you want to join me in the cafeteria?

9
00:00:25,335 --> 00:00:26,735
W: Sure, I will be right with you.

10
00:00:26,955 --> 00:00:30,250
Just give me a second to make a call to a client first.
